1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,833
Welcome to Class 1! Today we will learn about our daily routine in order.

2
00:00:05,833 --> 00:00:12,667
First, in the morning, we wake up early feeling rested, wash, and brush our teeth.

3
00:00:12,667 --> 00:00:18,233
Next, during the daytime, we eat breakfast, get dressed, and go to school.

4
00:00:18,233 --> 00:00:23,233
At night we sleep on time. That is our daily routine!
